              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.48+DEU.32.49+DEU.32.50+DEU.32.51+DEU.32.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32.48-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Go up into this mountain of Abarim, and see the land which I have given to the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you have seen it, you also shall be gathered to your people, as your brother Aaron was gathered, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because you rebelled against my word in the wilderness of Zin during the strife of the congregation, to sanctify me at the waters before their eyes.” (These are the waters of Meribah of Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Let the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of the spirits of all flesh, appoint a man over the congregation, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who shall go out before them and come in before them, who shall lead them out and bring them in; that the congregation of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " may not be as sheep which have no shepherd.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 3.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Take Joshua the son of Nun, a man in whom is the spirit, and lay your hand upon him; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cause him to stand before Eleazar the priest and all the congregation, and you shall commission him in their sight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall invest him with some of your authority, that all the congregation of the people of Israel may obey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall stand before Eleazar the priest, who shall inquire for him by the judgment of the Urim before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; at his word they shall go out, and at his word they shall come in, both he and all the people of Israel with him, the whole congregation.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses did as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded him; he took Joshua and caused him to stand before Eleazar the priest and the whole congregation, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he laid his hands upon him, and commissioned him as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " directed through Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
